14. Important Options to Remember

/fi  → Filter
eq   → Equal to

-a   → All connections/listening ports
-b   → Executable associated with connection
-o   → Process ID (PID)
-n   → Numerical addresses and ports

Example workflow

netstat -ano

Find a connection → identify its PID → check the process:

tasklist

Filter a particular process:

tasklist /fi "imagename eq sshd.exe"

Terminate a process by PID:

taskkill /pid 1234

